-- Canonical department specialists are catalogued without inventing authority or execution.
-- DISABLED means no trigger, executor or permissions have been validated for this specialist.
-- Existing operational department agents and exactly six D14 auditors remain untouched.
on conflict(agent_key) do nothing;
-- Prevent accidental promotion of a catalog-only agent through a stale broad model connector.
-- A specialist becomes executable only after a separate migration implements a trigger,
-- concrete capability, deterministic verification and an independent runtime gate.
